    {
      "fileName": "callow-may.json",
      "id": "IFvjnLMw3ht8f84U",
      "name": "Callow May",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "IFvjnLMw3ht8f84U",
        "folder": "cDR2FASsFdASuyjW",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Callow May",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You are among the most common of changelings—those born to sweet hags—and a vibrant green eye signifies that parentage. Your mother's manipulative nature and versatile voice gives you an edge when deceiving others. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Charming Liar] skill feat. If you roll Deception for initiative, foes in that combat encounter that haven't acted yet are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] against you.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "onlyLevel1": true,
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "GrantItem",
              "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Charming Liar"
            },
            {
              "key": "EphemeralEffect",
              "predicate": [
                "encounter:round:1",
                "self:participant:initiative:stat:deception",
                {
                  "lt": [
                    "self:participant:initiative:rank",
                    "target:participant:initiative:rank"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "selectors": [
                "strike-attack-roll",
                "spell-attack-roll",
                "strike-damage",
                "attack-spell-damage"
              ],
              "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard"
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "changeling",
              "lineage"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "ancestry"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "changeling-lore.json",
      "id": "4mLlHpD41101H0Iy",
      "name": "Changeling Lore",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "4mLlHpD41101H0Iy",
        "folder": "cDR2FASsFdASuyjW",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Changeling Lore",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>All too aware of your true nature, you've studied hags and their powers. You gain the trained proficiency rank in Deception and Occultism. If you would automatically become trained in one of those skills (from your background or class, for example), you instead become trained in a skill of your choice.</p>\n<p>You also gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Additional Lore] general feat for Hag Lore.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
              "mode": "upgrade",
              "path": "system.skills.deception.rank",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
              "mode": "upgrade",
              "path": "system.skills.occultism.rank",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "key": "GrantItem",
              "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Additional Lore"
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "changeling"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "ancestry"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "dream-may.json",
      "id": "kqnFdIhToKTnOpMl",
      "name": "Dream May",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "kqnFdIhToKTnOpMl",
        "folder": "cDR2FASsFdASuyjW",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Dream May",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You are the child of a cuckoo hag, making one of your eyes violet or even black. Your mother's powers over sleep and dreams have given you a degree of resistance to those effects, granting you a +2 circumstance bonus to all saving throws against sleep effects and effects that cause or alter dreams.</p>\n<p>In addition, sleep is more restorative for you. You regain HP equal to your Constitution modifier × double your level (instead of just × your level), and you reduce any drained and doomed conditions you have by 2 instead of by 1.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "onlyLevel1": true,
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "FlatModifier",
              "predicate": [
                {
                  "or": [
                    "sleep",
                    "dream"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "selector": "saving-throw",
              "type": "circumstance",
              "value": 2
            },
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
              "mode": "add",
              "path": "system.attributes.hp.recoveryMultiplier",
              "value": 1
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "changeling",
              "lineage"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "ancestry"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "hag-claws.json",
      "id": "Qb25uu1gT5CDMSWb",
      "name": "Hag Claws",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "Qb25uu1gT5CDMSWb",
        "folder": "cDR2FASsFdASuyjW",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Hag Claws",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>When you came of age, your fingernails grew long and sharp. You gain a claw unarmed attack that deals 1d4 slashing damage. Your claws are in the brawling group and have the agile, finesse, and unarmed traits.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Special</strong> Hag claws can develop at any point in a changeling's life. You can select this feat anytime you would gain an ancestry feat, but you can't retrain out of it.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "baseType": "claw",
              "category": "unarmed",
              "damage": {
                "base": {
                  "damageType": "slashing",
                  "dice": 1,
                  "die": "d4"
                }
              },
              "group": "brawling",
              "img": "icons/creatures/claws/claw-talons-glowing-orange.webp",
              "key": "Strike",
              "label": "PF2E.Weapon.Base.claw",
              "range": null,
              "traits": [
                "agile",
                "finesse",
                "unarmed"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "changeling"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "ancestry"
